<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-Shell Trophy standings after round four.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-Shell Trophy standings after round four.</headline>
<text>
<p>WELLINGTON, Jan 30 - Shell Trophy cricket competition standings after the completion of fourth round matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>(Points: 8 points for outright win, 4 points for first innings win).</p>
<p>    TEAM		   PLAYED   OUTRIGHT   1ST INN   TOTAL PTS</p>
<p>    Canterbury	     4	   32	   4	    36</p>
<p>    Otago		    4	   24	   4	    28</p>
<p>    Northern Districts   3	   16	   8	    24</p>
<p>    Wellington	     4	    8	   4	    12</p>
<p>    Central Districts    4	    8	   4	    12</p>
<p>    Auckland		 3	    0	   4	     4</p>
</text>
